The taxi is gone.
I stand alone on the street.
It is very cold.
The street is quiet and dark.
I see the building.
It is big and old.
I go to the front door.
The door is very heavy.
Next to the door is the bell panel.
There are many names here.
I read the names slowly.
I look for the name for my flat.
Ah, there is the name!
I look at my mobile phone.
I ask myself aloud: "Where is the flat?"
"Which floor is that?"
"Which staircase is right?"
"Is the flat upstairs?"
I take my suitcase.
I open the door and go inside.
